+STATUS: PARTIAL
+Lane initialized after the mandated read gate; dynamical T0--T3 are in progress.
+Target: half-chain magnon reflection, edge-label-changing amplitude, and quantised memory for fixed open AKLT.
+T2 will compare model-to-model agreement of `F(k)/(exp(ik)-1)`, not infer a power law.
+No repository files outside this lane are targeted; no `PATCH.md` is currently planned.
